[
  {
    "id": 2014004040010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "今度のお仕事は、まず私服でトークをして\r\nその後にミニライブ、って流れなんだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040140010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "016",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今まで出たイベントの中では１番の規模になるな\r\nだから、不安な点があったら聞いてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "不安てほどじゃないけど……\r\nトークは基本、フリートーク、なんだよね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本番でやるのは初めてだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何回か練習をしたと思うけど\r\n足りない感じがするなら、またやっておくか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん、大丈夫！\r\nプロデューサーさんやみんなと何回も練習したもんね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その後もおさらいしておこう\r\nトークの後は休憩が入って、ミニライブになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "amana"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこからは衣装になるから、衣装替えも入るぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん\r\n……あ、曲は、２曲で良かったよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、出演者それぞれが\r\nソロで２曲～３曲歌うことになっている",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ソロも今まで何回かやってるもんね……\r\nうん、大丈夫",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり緊張してるのか、甘奈？\r\nどことなく固い感じがするけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え？　そんなことないよ\r\n甘奈はいつも通り☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いつもと少し様子が違うことぐらい、わかるぞ\r\nこういうときくらい、無理をしなくて良い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ……やっぱりわかっちゃうか……\r\nじゃあ、ひとつだけお願い、しても良いかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、言ってみてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "トークパートで着る衣装なんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈が選んでも、良いかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは大丈夫だが……\r\n本番前に負担にならないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん、負担になんてならないよ\r\n……ダメ、かな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、甘奈がそうしたいのなら\r\nそうしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "良かった……\r\nありがと、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "これでホントに大丈夫になったよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
