  {
    "id": 2014004040170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、上手く歌えて良かった☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ、甘奈\r\n良かったぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへっ\r\nプロデューサーさんもお疲れ様☆",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（上手くできてホッとしているようだ）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "落ち着いてやれたな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "堂々としていたぞ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "歌が特に良かった",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040190,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　大丈夫だって言ったじゃん\r\n今日の甘奈は無敵なんだから☆",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうみたいだな\r\nあんなに不安そうだったのに、上手く切り替えられたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……なんでかわかる？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……うーん……\r\n……どうしてだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "わからないなら、秘密にしとくね☆",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言われると気になるじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ……何か思いついたら、言ってみてほしいな\r\nそしたら、正解かどうか教えてあげる！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、頑張って考えてみてね☆\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040240,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう見えてたなら、嬉しいかな……",
