  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと疲れが出たんだろう\r\n歩けそうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、大丈夫……\r\nただ……ちょっとお腹が空いたかも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら何かお腹に入れた方が良いな\r\n食べたいものはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ、前みたいに\r\nファミレスで一緒にご飯が食べたいかな☆",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400404/2014004040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、確か近くにあったから\r\nそこで良いか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004040280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　ありがと！\r\n頑張った後の甘いものって美味しいんだよね☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
